    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "\u201cIn a world burning down around you, what would you do to save the one place you have left?\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/d5b1e30f68dba8c2db9f6a745717099c.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/d5b1e30f68dba8c2db9f6a745717099c.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/d5b1e30f68dba8c2db9f6a745717099c.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Tactical Turn-Based RPG</strong><br>Bullet Maidens is a tactical turn-based shooter with RPG and visual novel elements. Help a squad of Taiwanese schoolgirls trying to keep their school and classmates safe while a war against an unknown and seemingly unstoppable army wages across the world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/e2a6f042dd4a9c76caf8b47087f54d2c.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/e2a6f042dd4a9c76caf8b47087f54d2c.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/e2a6f042dd4a9c76caf8b47087f54d2c.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Tactics with a Twist</strong><br>You are in control! Help the girls fight and survive in many hand crafted levels using an innovative combat system that doesn't rely on probabilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c43766449ba605e06f9868c29a21725c.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c43766449ba605e06f9868c29a21725c.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c43766449ba605e06f9868c29a21725c.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Adapt and Customize</strong><br>Earn powerful upgrades that can be applied as you want to help you survive each encounter. Find hidden synthesis combos to get the edge over enemies. Dress the girls in unlockable outfits and capture them in photos. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c7cc6bf6d58d86c610bc2df6b9964752.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c7cc6bf6d58d86c610bc2df6b9964752.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c7cc6bf6d58d86c610bc2df6b9964752.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Thrilling Occult Mystery Story</strong><br>Follow the twists and turns of a dramatic story as each girl attempts to face the new situation they are in. As things get darker and more desperate, the girls will discover a deeper level of reality than they had ever known before and the horrors that dwell there.<br><br>Lead them to the final revelation that may be their only salvation.",
    "about_the_game": "\u201cIn a world burning down around you, what would you do to save the one place you have left?\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/d5b1e30f68dba8c2db9f6a745717099c.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/d5b1e30f68dba8c2db9f6a745717099c.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/d5b1e30f68dba8c2db9f6a745717099c.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Tactical Turn-Based RPG</strong><br>Bullet Maidens is a tactical turn-based shooter with RPG and visual novel elements. Help a squad of Taiwanese schoolgirls trying to keep their school and classmates safe while a war against an unknown and seemingly unstoppable army wages across the world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/e2a6f042dd4a9c76caf8b47087f54d2c.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/e2a6f042dd4a9c76caf8b47087f54d2c.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/e2a6f042dd4a9c76caf8b47087f54d2c.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Tactics with a Twist</strong><br>You are in control! Help the girls fight and survive in many hand crafted levels using an innovative combat system that doesn't rely on probabilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c43766449ba605e06f9868c29a21725c.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c43766449ba605e06f9868c29a21725c.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c43766449ba605e06f9868c29a21725c.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Adapt and Customize</strong><br>Earn powerful upgrades that can be applied as you want to help you survive each encounter. Find hidden synthesis combos to get the edge over enemies. Dress the girls in unlockable outfits and capture them in photos. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c7cc6bf6d58d86c610bc2df6b9964752.poster.avif?t=1746296580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c7cc6bf6d58d86c610bc2df6b9964752.webm?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333410/extras/c7cc6bf6d58d86c610bc2df6b9964752.mp4?t=1746296580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Thrilling Occult Mystery Story</strong><br>Follow the twists and turns of a dramatic story as each girl attempts to face the new situation they are in. As things get darker and more desperate, the girls will discover a deeper level of reality than they had ever known before and the horrors that dwell there.<br><br>Lead them to the final revelation that may be their only salvation.",
